==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|mono|theistic}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌmɒnə(ʊ)θɪˈɪstɪk/|/ˌmɒnə(ʊ)θiːˈɪstɪk/|a=UK}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˌmɑnəθiˈɪstɪk/|a=US}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|religion}} Believing in a single [[god]], [[deity]], [[spirit]], etc., especially for an organized [[religion]], [[faith]], or [[creed]].

